{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/b4ffdb2a0f0dfc0c1df697c31ea8638d.poster.avif?t=1771558590\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/b4ffdb2a0f0dfc0c1df697c31ea8638d.webm?t=1771558590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/b4ffdb2a0f0dfc0c1df697c31ea8638d.mp4?t=1771558590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>world of dreams</strong> in this <strong>esoteric roguelike deckbuilder</strong>. In the battle against the nightmare, use your cards to apply effects and combos that will lead you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Build a unique deck</strong> each campaign by interacting with <strong>distinct characters</strong> and acquiring new cards. Here, deckbuilding decisions happen both before and during matches: <i>every choice matters!</i> Throughout the match, buy cards from the shop and manipulate the flow of your deck, making it smoother and stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/45ef2f66f3fddb76b83eb6123781cf77.avif?t=1771558590\" width=1560 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/f9d32df3bd3e8604bda4217f95368bea.poster.avif?t=1771558590\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/f9d32df3bd3e8604bda4217f95368bea.webm?t=1771558590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/f9d32df3bd3e8604bda4217f95368bea.mp4?t=1771558590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The match is divided into action and buy phases</strong>. In the action phase, you use your cards to move through your deck and accumulate <strong>imagination points</strong>. These points are used to acquire cards during the buy phase and power up your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over <strong>100 unique cards</strong> divided into 6 different strategies that can be mixed as you like<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/d1871a3befce694e534e54236ca94317.avif?t=1771558590\" width=1560 height=278 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/e4520e2f6f1dcf4397d82e6e097b9d89.poster.avif?t=1771558590\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/e4520e2f6f1dcf4397d82e6e097b9d89.webm?t=1771558590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/e4520e2f6f1dcf4397d82e6e097b9d89.mp4?t=1771558590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in the match is to accumulate conscience points during the acquisition phase. Use these points to reach a <strong>lucid dream state </strong>and <strong>defeat the monster</strong>. Surpass the monster\u2019s score for 7 nights to get rid of it\u2014but be careful! <strong>If you fail even one night, the monster will overpower you with a nightmare.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/73b2558e58486a8d02a3e7ae277ea20d.avif?t=1771558590\" width=1560 height=278 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/b3f5511cedb7e4a3535198a6258b1309.poster.avif?t=1771558590\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/b3f5511cedb7e4a3535198a6258b1309.webm?t=1771558590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/extras/b3f5511cedb7e4a3535198a6258b1309.mp4?t=1771558590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cards represent actions and characters from your daily life with whom you interact during the day</strong>. At night, you use these cards in your dream, creating a <strong>bizarre narrative</strong> with unexpected interactions between characters and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the <strong>dark memories</strong> linked to each card in this roguelike deckbuilder with hand-drawn illustrations and cards created by the main character themself: <strong>The Self</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726730?t=1771558590","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726730?t=1771558590","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/89e412034d7825221df7def93b2ddaa88129de7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771558590","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726730/89e412034d7825221df7def93b2ddaa88129de7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771558590","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3852780,"description":""}],"detai